---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<!-- LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED: Replace this preliminary content before public launch. -->
<BaseLayout title="Preliminary Terms" description="Preliminary terms for the local DepthLume website prototype." path="/terms/">
  <article class="container prose-page">
    <header><span class="eyebrow">Legal / Preliminary</span><h1>Terms of use</h1><p class="lede">These headings record intended product boundaries for review. They are not final or effective legal terms.</p></header>
    <div class="provisional">Final legal drafting and jurisdiction-specific review are required before public launch or beta distribution.</div>
    <section><h2>Informational purpose</h2><p>The website describes a market analytics and research product. Website and application content must not be treated as financial, investment, legal or tax advice.</p></section>
    <section><h2>No trade execution</h2><p>DepthLume does not execute trades, connect to a user’s trading account, manage funds or guarantee any result.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Product availability</h2><p>Features, supported markets, system requirements, beta capacity and release timing remain subject to validation. Preliminary descriptions do not create a commitment to deliver unfinished functionality.</p></section>
    <section><h2>User responsibility</h2><p>Users remain solely responsible for evaluating information, complying with applicable rules and making their own decisions. Futures trading can result in rapid and substantial losses.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Intellectual property and acceptable use</h2><p>Final terms must define ownership, license scope, restrictions, feedback rights and acceptable use before software distribution.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Official legal contact pending: <code>{site.contactPlaceholder}</code>.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
